<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets 200 mln stg 5-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets 200 mln stg 5-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Morgan Stanley and Dean Witter International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MORGAN STANLEY GROUP INC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY   *02.APR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     15 BP     PAY DATE    03.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.87     FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.87</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALLABLE FROM APRIL 1999 AT PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
